      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "King David also dedicated these to the LORD, with the silver and gold that he dedicated of all the nations which he subdued—",
      "ko": "다윗왕이 그것도 여호와께 드리되 저가 정복한 모든 나라에서 얻은 은금",
      "source_text_hash": "32d428ea7a12c68fd53fb2217aa7d63c14bdf058cdcc3b364e6fc21cd54c99f8",
      "translation_text_hash": "1ef885f162947f1443fd0d937bb8d319347086550dd33a191dcfa7ccaeb200ae",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "다윗왕이 그것도 여호와께 드리되 저가 정복한 모든 나라에서 얻은 은금"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1ef885f162947f1443fd0d937bb8d319347086550dd33a191dcfa7ccaeb200ae"
      ]
    },
