        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "David earned a reputation when he returned from striking down eighteen thousand men of the Syrians in the Valley of Salt.",
      "ko": "다윗이 염곡에서 에돔 사람 일만 팔천을 쳐죽이고 돌아와서 명예를 얻으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5882d01bf94fd7eba2c116a6005709fb6e46dfb6862bec576b0550d40a5e8e16",
      "translation_text_hash": "974e8c9838edb9616f1ceecc6e487ab621a5ee9d23a6bc538f9d946b93e8dc67",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "다윗이 염곡에서 에돔 사람 일만 팔천을 쳐죽이고 돌아와서 명예를 얻으니라"
